 of the acquisition; 6. Cost of acquisition or the price at which the shares are acquired; 7. Nature of consideration - whether cash consideration or share swap and details of the same; 8. Brief background about the entity acquired in terms of products/line of business acquired, date of incorporation, history of last 3 years turnover, country in which the acquired entity has presence and any other significant information (in brief). The response of the Company is attached.", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Reply to Clarification Sought", "difference": "00:00:08", "dt": "07092023141314", "exchdisstime": "07-Sep-2023 14:13:22", "fileSize": "-", "hasXbrl": false, "old_new": null, "orgid": null, "seq_id": "105613083", "smIndustry": null, "sm_isin": "INE121N01019", "sm_name": "Thejo Engineering Limited", "sort_date": "2023-09-07 14:13:14", "symbol": "THEJO"}, {"an_dt": "30-Aug-2023 21:13:42", "attFileSize": null, "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/THEJO_30082023211342_NSE_VotingRes_ScruReport_2023.pdf", "attchmntText": "Thejo Engineering Limited has submitted the Exchange a copy Srutinizers report of  Annual General Meeting held on August 30, 2023. Further, the company has informed the Exchange regarding voting results.", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Shareholders meeting", "difference": "00:00:03", "dt": "30082023211342", "exchdisstime": "30-Aug-2023 21:13:45", "fileSize": "-", "hasXbrl": false, "old_new": null, "orgid": null, "seq_id": "105604428", "smIndustry": null, "sm_isin": "INE121N01019", "sm_name": "Thejo Engineering Limited", "sort_date": "2023-08-30 21:13:42", "symbol": "THEJO"}, {"an_dt": "30-Aug-2023 13:20:21", "attFileSize": null, "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/THEJO_30082023132021_Proceedings_37thAGM_NSEFiling.pdf", "attchmntText": "Thejo Engineering Limited has informed the Exchange regarding Proceedings of the 37th Annual General Meeting held on August 30, 2023 at The Music Academy